Notes:
* {{psl|Iron Reflexes}} and {{psl|Ghost Dance}} are based on ''evasion rating'', which is not the same as ''evade chance''. Thus it is compatible with {{psl|Unwavering Stance}}.
* {{psl|Elemental Overload}} + {{psl|Perfect Agony}}: Prevents hits from applying [[ailment]]s entirely, since ailments will never be considered to be applied by a critical strike.
* {{psl|Vaal Pact}} + {{psl|Zealot's Oath}}: Life regeneration will not apply to energy shield, but energy shield regeneration will still function.
* {{psl|Vaal Pact}} + {{psl|Ghost Reaver}}: Negates the instant leech effect from Vaal Pact.
* {{psl|Pain Attunement}} can be used with {{psl|Chaos Inoculation}} with effects that treat your character as if they're on low life (ex. {{il|Coward's Legacy}}).
* {{psl|Black Scythe Training}} prevents armour and evasion from affecting physical damage reduction and evade chance, but your Armour/Evasion Rating itself is unchanged. Therefore, it is compatible with effects which scale with those values.
* While {{psl|Eldritch Battery}}, {{psl|Corrupted Soul}}, {{psl|id=The_agnostic_keystone2695}}, and {{psl|Divine Flesh}} can theoretically be combined with {{psl|Chaos Inoculation}}, it will severely impact the character's survivability.

